    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "--- Group 5: nested patterns that contain a valid key at the innermost level, but the outer expression itself cannot be resolved --- e.g., \"${$${a}}\" — the inner \"${a}\" resolves to \"1\", making the outer key \"$${1}\" which is not in the map, so the whole expression is left unchanged."
   },
